# About this project

This project is built with vikejs, using hono for the backend and react for the frontend.
It is implemented with react, hono, better-auth, drizzle, vikejs, storybook, trpc, vite, vitest, tailwind

- ./(client) contains the UI for this project
    - ./(client)/components are where all react components should live
    - ./(client)/hooks are where all react hooks should live
    - ./(client)/pages/* are where all the route components live
- ./assets are for all files that are served to the frontend
- ./auth contains all (most) the better-auth related config and code
- ./drizzle contains all (most) the drizzle-orm config and code
- ./server contains all (most) of the server side code
- ./stories contains all of the storybook stories